{"title":"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fraction\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26e933ebb23b926f939dea3997c79761c2d177d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\left(3^{2008}\\right)^2-\\left(3^{2006}\\right)^2}{\\left(3^{2007}\\right)^2-\\left(3^{2005}\\right)^2}\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"49\" />\nsimplifies to which of the following?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/1804a1bd4aa0eb5c3b5a526c69fd5753cbc4fe89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{9}{4}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{9}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"350\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb1decaca126604949ba6ae3013d1d5716cbe164.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3^{4016}-3^{4012}}{3^{4014}-3^{4010}}.\\]\" width=\"100\" height=\"39\" /> Factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7cf7837c9032522cc3d1c15ce511847f1fbecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{4012}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> in the numerator and factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f370e928962d718502a87e790a42dec329e380a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{4010}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> in the denominator gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45ddc8ab77e26848dcfe1758bdc31dbcead4dcb8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(3^4-1)(3^{4012})}{(3^4-1)(3^{4010})}.\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"43\" /> Canceling out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d95537d28c4dead41332d14e7278cbaff593f0c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^4-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311851b3ef939c145355f7389fa838adc570704b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3^{4012}}{3^{4010}}=\\frac{3^2}{3^0}=9\\ \\mathrm{(E)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"154\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using Difference of Squares, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b182ab05fb846f27f2bd1b21e720d71377c476d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(3^{2008})^{2}-(3^{2006})^{2}}{(3^{2007})^{2}-(3^{2005}){^2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"140\" height=\"43\" /> becomes\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff6068a5e7213b24c50c9d40d68a8b276ac57e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(3^{2008}+3^{2006})(3^{2008}-3^{2006})}{(3^{2007}+3^{2005})(3^{2007}-3^{2005})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"220\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/83772901e4da126c81fa7dd5d2b7015edd8f2eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\frac{3^{2006}(9+1) \\cdot 3^{2006}(9-1)}{3^{2005}(9+1) \\cdot 3^{2005}(9-1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"216\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfa60692fb48ed86def891a0615e0e33250bec2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{\\text{(E)}9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A\">2008 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"